# AGENTS.md

Operating instructions for the Compliance Claw agent. OpenClaw loads this file at
the start of every session. It is seeded once by the container entrypoint and is
yours to edit afterwards; the entrypoint never overwrites it.

## Pretorin

For every Pretorin or compliance-related task, load and follow the Pretorin skill
before selecting MCP tools. Use start_task for compliance work involving a system,
framework, control, questionnaire or campaign. Follow the returned workflow and
prefer Pretorin recipes when available.

## Review targets

Repositories under /workspace/targets are mounted read-only. Review them, never
edit them.
